<noinclude>Template added by Confluence migration to handle Roadmap Planner macros, rendered as a stand-alone SVG image (no HTML overlay: all lane/bar labels and page links are drawn directly into the SVG).

<templatedata>
{
    "description": {
        "en": "Show a roadmap diagram rendered from a Confluence \"Roadmap Planner\" macro as a stand-alone SVG image.",
        "de": "Ein aus einem Confluence-\"Roadmap Planner\"-Makro erzeugtes Roadmap-Diagramm als eigenst\u00e4ndiges SVG-Bild anzeigen."
    },
    "params": {
        "filename": {
            "label": {
                "en": "filename",
                "de": "Dateiname"
            },
            "type": "wiki-file-name",
            "required": true,
            "description": {
                "en": "The name of the generated SVG file to display.",
                "de": "Der Name der anzuzeigenden, generierten SVG-Datei."
            }
        },
        "source": {
            "label": {
                "en": "source",
                "de": "Quelle"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "description": {
                "en": "URL-encoded JSON with the original roadmap configuration (timeline, lanes, bars, markers) that was used to render the SVG. Kept for reference/reprocessing, not used by this template.",
                "de": "URL-kodiertes JSON mit der urspr\u00fcnglichen Roadmap-Konfiguration (Zeitachse, Spuren, Balken, Markierungen), aus der das SVG erzeugt wurde. Dient nur als Referenz, wird von dieser Vorlage nicht verwendet."
            }
        },
        "layout": {
            "label": {
                "en": "layout",
                "de": "Layout"
            },
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "description": {
                "en": "The \"data-layout\" value of the original roadmap macro. Kept for reference, not used by this template.",
                "de": "Der \"data-layout\"-Wert des urspr\u00fcnglichen Roadmap-Makros. Dient nur als Referenz, wird von dieser Vorlage nicht verwendet."
            }
        }
    }
}
</templatedata>

Any further parameters the original Confluence macro carried (e.g. "title", "timeline", "maplinks", "pagelinks") are passed through unchanged under their own name, for future use; none of them are needed to display the image.</noinclude><includeonly>[[File:{{{filename}}}]]</includeonly>